OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly but bright start.
OL,6,FTurning cloudy into the afternoon from
OL,7,Fthe west, with this thickening before
OL,8,Fthe rain arriving into the evening.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine and
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Fmostly light rain, continuing into the
OL,14,Fearly hours of Friday. Feeling much
OL,15,Fmilder than last night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FRain with blustery winds
OL,18,Fbefore clearing into the evening with
OL,19,Fwinds easing. A few brighter spells on
OL,20,Foffer for the remainder of the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
